- How would you mitigate edge artifacts in patch stitching during reconstruction?

## Why This Is Asked
Tests practical ICA pipeline design on real-world-like sensor data, including preprocessing, component selection, and robust evaluation. It also probes familiarity with common ICA algorithms and stability considerations across seeds.

## Key Concepts
- Centering and scaling inputs
- Whitening (PCA) before ICA
- Choosing n_components and nonlinearity
- Noise robustness and stability across seeds
- Evaluation with SDR/SIR against ground truth

## Code Example
```javascript
// ICA pipeline skeleton (pseudocode)
const X = [/* 2 x N data */];
const Xc = demeanAndScale(X);
const Xw = whiten(Xc);
const ica = new FastICA({nComponents:2, nonlinearity:'logcosh'});
const S = ica.fitTransform(Xw);
```

